# The three EXPO_PUBLIC_* values go here. `.env.example` is the template and is
# committed; `.env` holds a real Supabase anon key and a real API hostname and
# is not. The anon key is designed to ship in clients, but the hostname tells
# anyone reading the repo where your deployment lives, so keep the file local.
.env
.env.local
